 "name_en": "Sell from Stock with Valuated Stock in Transit (5MQ)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sell from Stock with Valuated Stock in Transit (5MQ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio75dfcb9b01a342c3bca82ad8341879e4\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio75dfcb9b01a342c3bca82ad8341879e4__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Sell from Stock with Valuated Stock in Transit lets you use valuated stock in transit (VSIT). After the goods issue is posted to an outbound delivery, the stock is transferred into VSIT. With the transfer of control of the delivered goods to the customer (for example, based on incoterms and transportation management), the goods issue from VSIT to the customer is posted. At this point in time, revenue and COGS can be recognized.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The material movements are done based on configuration settings and are posted automatically through a process orchestration framework, called Value Change Management (VCM).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio75dfcb9b01a342c3bca82ad8341879e4__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Sales Order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Outbound Delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Stock Transfer from physical stock to Valuated Stock in Transit (VSIT)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post Goods Issue from VSIT to Customer</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Customer Invoice</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use Value Chain Monitor to track postings</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio75dfcb9b01a342c3bca82ad8341879e4__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support the use of existing sales document type, item category, and schedule line category</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Support legal compliance with event-based revenue recognition (IFRS 15 matching principle)</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>含已评估在途库存的现货销售 (5MQ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio75dfcb9b01a342c3bca82ad8341879e4\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio75dfcb9b01a342c3bca82ad8341879e4__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">含已评估在途库存的现货销售允许您使用已评估在途库存 (VSIT)。将发货过账到出库交货后，库存将传输到 VSIT。通过将交付的货物控制权转移给客户（例如，基于国际贸易条款和运输管理），将发货从 VSIT 过账到客户。此时，可以确认收入和 COGS。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">物料移动基于配置设置完成，并通过称为值变更管理 (VCM) 的流程编排框架自动过账。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio75dfcb9b01a342c3bca82ad8341879e4__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建出库交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建从实际库存到已评估在途库存 (VSIT) 的库存转储</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将发货从 VSIT 过账到客户</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建客户发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用价值链监控器跟踪过账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio75dfcb9b01a342c3bca82ad8341879e4__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持使用现有销售凭证类型、项目类别和计划行类别</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持基于事件的收入确认的法律合规性（IFRS 15 匹配原则）</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
